    <comment>[safety] Body of the confirmation dialog for a real cleanup when 'Send to Recycle Bin' is off, so the files are destroyed. {0} is a formatted size such as '1.2 GB'. PERMANENTLY is capitalised in English for emphasis; keep the same emphasis and never soften 'cannot be undone'.</comment>
